                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i3/Ryzen 3 series<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 6 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Nvidia GTX 900/AMD RX 400 series | Intel Iris Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 120 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> This game may be updated over time and have paid for and free. additional content released for it. Please be aware that this may increase the minimum requirements for running the game above the specification stated here. Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel i5/Ryzen 5 series<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1660 Ti/AMD RX 5600-XT/Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 120 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> 8GB Memory if using integrated GPU. Microsoft no longer supports Windows 10 or older versions.</li></ul>"
            },
            "mac_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> macOS 15.7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Apple M1 (8‑Core CPU) or better<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> Apple M1 (7‑Core GPU) or better<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 125 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> <ul class=\"bb_ul\">The game is officially supported on all Mac models released since November 2020 with an Apple M1 chip or better. To check your Mac model and when it was released, select About This Mac from the Apple menu on your menu bar.</ul> ——— <ul class=\"bb_ul\">The following Macs are capable of running the game but do not consistently meet the standards required for official support: <li> * All Mac models with an AMD GPU that support macOS 15.7 </li></ul></li></ul>"
            },
            "linux_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 3.4GHz Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD Ryzen CPU equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 4GB or AMD Radeon RX 470 4GB<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 125 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Requires Vulkan, NVIDIA driver version 470.xx or later required (tested), AMD Mesa driver version 23.2.1 or later required (tested), Intel GPUs are not supported at the time of release</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> 3.4GHz Intel Core i7-4770 or AMD Ryzen CPU equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 8GB or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 125 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Requires Vulkan, NVIDIA driver version 470.xx or later required (tested), AMD Mesa driver version 23.2.1 or later required (tested), Intel GPUs are not supported at the time of release</li></ul>"
